 "stimulus_html": "A biologist is comparing three treatments of light intensity on plant growth and is interested to know if the average plant growth is different for any of the three treatments.<br>\nSample data is collected on plant growth (in centimeters) for the three treatments, and data is summarized in the table below.<br>\nUse an ANOVA hypothesis test method with 0.05 level of significance.\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Treatment A</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Treatment B</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Treatment C</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4.3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3.9</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3.7</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3.1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3.6</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">3.4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3.5</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4.1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">4.0</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.4</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">N/A</td>\n<td align=\"center\">n/a</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption></caption>\n</table>\n",
